                ANNOUNCEMENTS
            </div>
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold">Platform Updates & News</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">Stay informed on newly released modules, scheduled workshops, and platform enhancements.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
