                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1">Modern Technology Stacks</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Learn C#, ASP.NET Core, React, SQL Server, and Cloud infrastructure using contemporary industry conventions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="p-2 rounded-circle bg-primary-subtle text-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle fs-5"></i>
                        </div>
